WebP/VP8L decoder attribution
============================

The following files are adapted from golang.org/x/image v0.38.0:

  decode.go                         from webp/decode.go
  internal/vp8l/decode.go            from vp8l/decode.go
  internal/vp8l/huffman.go           from vp8l/huffman.go
  internal/vp8l/transform.go         from vp8l/transform.go

